只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Per-session automatic compaction threshold for DeepSeek Harness: a compaction backend whose trigger percentage is stored per session and adjustable from the Web composer while the session runs.","id":"gh:1389421771","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-compaction-threshold","slug":"windwhiterain/dsh-compaction-threshold","topics":["agent","compaction","context-window","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Per-session automatic compaction threshold for DeepSeek Harness: a compaction backend whose trigger "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"percentage is stored per session and adjustable from the Web composer while the session runs."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-compaction-threshold"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Per-session automatic compaction threshold for DeepSeek Harness, adjustable from the Web composer "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"while a session runs.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The shipped backend (`@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic`) fixes the trigger\npercentage in the agent "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"preset: one number for every session that preset serves,\nchangeable only by editing YAML and reloadi"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ng the host. That is the wrong\ngranularity for real work — a long refactor wants to compact late and"},{"id":"p4s4","text":" keep its\nhistory verbatim, a scratch session wants to compact early and stay cheap, and\nneither sho"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"uld require a host restart."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"This plugin keeps the same compaction transaction and makes the percentage **per\nsession**: a chip b"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"eside the permission and model chips shows the value, a menu\nchanges it in one click, `/compaction-t"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"hreshold` does the same from the keyboard,\nand the value is stored durably beside the session log so"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" it survives a restart.\nA forked session and a delegated subagent inherit their parent's value."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The package is **third-party**, and it is honest about its coupling: a compaction\nbackend must be a "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"subclass of the shipped engine, so unlike a plugin that only\ntalks to the Cordis context, this one i"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"mports\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic` and copies its trigger policy. Read\nKnown limitations bef"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ore upgrading the harness."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- What it looks like\n- Quick start\n- Use\n- Inheritance\n- How it works\n- Model experience\n- Verificat"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ion\n- Developing against a dev host\n- Known limitations"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What it looks like"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The chip sits with the permission and model chips in the composer, and shows the\nsession's current p"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"its with the permission and model chips in the composer, and shows the\nsession's current percentage:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The menu offers the preset default and 30 %–100 %. Here the session is a fork\nthat inherited its par"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ent's 70 %, so the menu also states where the value came\nfrom:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Once a request has been measured, the chip's tooltip and the menu heading report\nthe token count the"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" trigger resolved to, so the percentage in force is visible\nrather than implied."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then wire two rows into `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` — one on the host\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Two rows, because a compaction backend and the interface that configures it live\non different planes"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"wo rows, because a compaction backend and the interface that configures it live\non different planes:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Row | Plane | Owns |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| `dsh-compaction-threshold` | Host | The storage domain keyed by Session id, the `compactionThresho"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ld` Session projection, and the `/compaction-threshold` command |\n| `dsh-compaction-threshold/engine"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"` | Agent preset, inside its `compaction` group | The `ctx.compaction` service: the shipped engine w"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ith a per-session pressure ratio |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The engine reads the value synchronously from the host service and falls back to\nits own configured "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"`thresholdRatio` when the host row is absent, so a miswired\ncomposition degrades to the shipped beha"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"viour instead of disabling compaction.\nContext-overflow recovery, retention, pruning, retries, and s"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ummarization are\ninherited unchanged."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Why the override lives in a storage domain, not the session log"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The Session persistence reader refuses an event type outside the generated\nknown-type catalog unless"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" the record carries `ignorable: true`\n(`packages/session/session-persistence/src/storage-contract.ts"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`), and\n`Session.append()` cannot set that marker. A plugin outside the harness\nrepository therefore"},{"id":"p21s4","text":" cannot add a Session event: its own logs would stop loading.\nThe override is non-session applicatio"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"n data, so it belongs in\n`ctx.storageDomain`, and the client is notified through a Session projectio"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"n —\nwhich is key-addressed and needs no client code per domain."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"#### What the model sees"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Nothing directly: the plugin adds no tool and no prompt text. Indirectly it\nchanges when a `<compact"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ed-summary>` checkpoint replaces older history and how\nmuch recent history stays verbatim, exactly a"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"s the shipped backend does."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- **One divergence from the shipped backend, by design.** The threshold is a\nplain window fraction; "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"the shipped backend would cap it at\n`window − outputReservation − headroomTokens`, which can compres"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"s the whole\n25 %–100 % range of the knob onto one value. Span selection, the summarization\ntransacti"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"on, retention, pruning, and retries are still transcribed from\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic` 0"},{"id":"p25s5","text":".1.7-rc.1 (`src/region.ts`\n`selectCompactableRange` and the engine's transaction). Those internals a"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"re not\nexported, so an upstream change must be mirrored here by hand, and the `Config`\nschema is inh"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"erited from the installed package rather than owned. The probe\npins the arithmetic, not upstream fil"},{"id":"p25s8","text":"e contents.\n- **A high percentage can still hit a provider overflow.** The request must fit\nthe prov"},{"id":"p25s9","text":"ider's window with its reserved completion, and the upstream recovery\npath compacts on a provider-co"},{"id":"p25s10","text":"nfirmed overflow without consulting the ratio. A\npercentage controls the threshold; the provider con"},{"id":"p25s11","text":"trols its own limit.\n- **A threshold cannot fix pressure that lives in the tool schemas.** Compactio"},{"id":"p25s12","text":"n\nis only attempted when the budget is crossed, and the transaction refuses a\nsummary that is not sm"},{"id":"p25s13","text":"aller than the span it replaces. In a deployment whose\ndeclared window is barely larger than its own"},{"id":"p25s14","text":" tool catalog, the engine prunes,\ntries a summary, and honestly reports\n`summary is not smaller than"},{"id":"p25s15","text":" the shadowed content`. A ratio changes *when* the\nengine tries; it cannot create headroom the surfa"},{"id":"p25s16","text":"ce does not hold.\n- **A snapshot is taken at the child's first observation, not at the fork.**\nThe S"},{"id":"p25s17","text":"ession store emits no creation or fork event, so lineage is read from\n`SessionHeader.parentSession` "},{"id":"p25s18","text":"and the copy happens the first time the child is\nread (the engine's pressure check or the projection"},{"id":"p25s19","text":"). An ancestor that changes\nits value between the fork and that first observation is what the child\n"},{"id":"p25s20","text":"inherits, and a child that owns no record yet still inherits a value its\nancestor sets later; owning"},{"id":"p25s21","text":" any record spends the inheritance for good.\n- **A child inherits only where the engine is mounted.*"},{"id":"p25s22","text":"* A child keeps its\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
